flowchart LR
    A[Developer Commit] --> B[Push Feature Branch]
    B --> C[Pull Request]
    C --> D[CI: Test + Build]
    D --> E[Image Build]
    E --> F[Image Scan]
    F --> G[Push to Registry]
    G --> H[Deploy Staging]
    H --> I[Smoke Tests]
    I --> J[Manual Approval]
    J --> K[Deploy Production]
    K --> L[Monitor + Alert]
    L --> M[Feedback to Backlog]
